- [ ] **Network Loss**: Disconnect internet while in position
- [ ] **Clock Skew**: Change system time during operation
- [ ] **Disk Full**: Fill up disk while logging
- [ ] **CPU Spike**: Run CPU-intensive task alongside
- [ ] **Duplicate Data**: Send same tick twice
- [ ] **Out-of-Order Data**: Send old timestamps
- [ ] **Missing Fields**: Send incomplete data objects
- [ ] **Extreme Values**: Test with price = 0, Infinity, -1
- [ ] **Rapid Connect/Disconnect**: Spam reconnections
- [ ] **Multi-Instance**: Run two bots on same ports
- [ ] **Permission Errors**: Remove write access to log dir
- [ ] **API Limits**: Simulate rate limiting
- [ ] **Memory Pressure**: Run with --max-old-space-size=512
